Content follows the common telling of the Ramayana; the floating stones marked with Rama's name and the link between the
homecoming and Diwali are popular traditions (customs vary by region). The column is a storytelling device, not a map.
Everything else (score, foley, paper, all painting) is original and generated in code for this film.
Rendering and tools: the Lemo-Opuscar style library (Watercolor Brush style) and its core/ tools.
